msgstr "Oxirgi %1$s daqiqa"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Umumiy ko'rinish"

msgid "Back to %1$s"
msgstr "%1$s ga qaytish"

msgid "Remove application"
msgstr "Ilovani olib tashlash"

msgid "Remove service"
msgstr "Xizmatni olib tashlash"

msgid "Remove application \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "\"%1$s\" ilovasi xaritadan olib tashlansinmi?"

msgid "Remove service \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "\"%1$s\" xizmati xaritadan olib tashlansinmi?"

msgid "Its services, databases and external calls leave the map. Services shared with other applications stay."
msgstr "Uning xizmatlari, ma'lumotlar bazalari va tashqi chaqiruvlari xaritadan yo'qoladi. Boshqa ilovalar bilan umumiy xizmatlar qoladi."

msgid "The service, its connections, databases and external calls leave the map."
msgstr "Xizmat, uning aloqalari, ma'lumotlar bazalari va tashqi chaqiruvlari xaritadan yo'qoladi."

msgid "If the application is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Agar ilova yangi treyslarda qayta aniqlansa, u barcha obyektlari bilan avtomatik qayta yaratiladi."

msgid "If the service is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Agar xizmat yangi treyslarda qayta aniqlansa, u barcha obyektlari bilan avtomatik qayta yaratiladi."

msgid "Hosts, items and triggers in Zabbix are not changed."
msgstr "Zabbix dagi xostlar, elementlar va triggerlar o'zgartirilmaydi."

msgid "Remove %1$s"
msgstr "%1$s ni olib tashlash"

msgid "No data found"
msgstr "Ma'lumot topilmadi"

msgid "No APM span matches the attribute filter in the selected time range. Change the filter above or press Reset to see everything."
msgstr "Tanlangan vaqt oralig'ida atribut filtriga mos APM span yo'q. Yuqoridagi filtrni o'zgartiring yoki hammasini ko'rish uchun Tiklash tugmasini bosing."

msgid "No APM traces in the selected time range and no host with the apm.requests item. Services appear here as soon as the applications send traces to the Zabbix proxy."
msgstr "Tanlangan vaqt oralig'ida APM treyslari yo'q va apm.requests elementiga ega xost yo'q. Ilovalar Zabbix proxy ga treys yuborishi bilan xizmatlar shu yerda paydo bo'ladi."

